# Modern document: Unicode + RGB
size 120 40
spawn
wait "Welcome" 10s
keys esc
keys ctrl-n
wait "New document"
keys down down right
keys enter
wait "Modern"
keys alt-c
wait "Colors"
keys tab
type ff8800
keys enter enter
keys t
type ╭──╮ λ → ★ ✓
keys esc
wait idle
expect "MODERN"
expect "★"
shot modern
